Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, let's play one more time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  好  再玩一次  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And remember, if I win,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住如果我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you do not move to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赢了你就不能去巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm risking this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不敢相信我又冒一次险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:11.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:11.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Joe, you remember the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了规则  乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heads, I win. Tails, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正面是我赢  反面是你输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点扔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Tails! - Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-啊  是反面  -该死的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we thought we'd throw you a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  我们为你准备了一个送行会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}going-away party around 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}7点钟开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  听起来不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Rach, you're leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  瑞秋  你明天就要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shouldn't you be packing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在还不开始收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:32.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's all done. - Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:32.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-已经收拾好了  -哈  是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And after I took a shower this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天早上我冲澡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just threw my towel on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还把毛巾扔在地上了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, it hurts to even joke about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  天哪  就算是开玩笑我都心疼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, seriously, I did it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  我是说真的  我全都收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The luggage that I'm taking is in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要带的行李都在卧室里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Emma's Paris stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些是艾玛要在巴黎用的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These are the boxes that I'm having shipped...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些箱子都是要托运的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and that's the sandwich I made for the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个是我打算飞机上吃的三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so you've done some good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来你干得还不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:53.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:53.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about your carryons?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的手提行李呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, everything that I need is in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}需要的东西全都在这个包里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my travel documents are on the counter...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而旅行要用到的证件都在台子上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...organized in the order that I will be needing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经把它们按照使用顺序排好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:08.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. I have nothing left to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:08.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我好像没什么要教你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where's your passport?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的护照呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:13.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It should be next to my plane ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:13.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该跟我的机票下面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯...没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Well, maybe I put it in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有吗  也许我放在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's not in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:19.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢  没有  不在这儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I must have packed it in one of these boxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我肯定是把它封在这些箱子里了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Here, let me help you. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我来帮你   -倒霉...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe i did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信... 我竟然乱放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At what point did
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从什么时间点开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:33.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it stop being funny that I took her passport?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:33.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把她的护照藏起来不好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S10E16 The One With Rachel's Going Away Party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第十季  第16集  给瑞秋饯行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow, can you believe you're only three weeks away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只剩三个礼拜了  真是让人难以相信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:30.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't mind me touching your belly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:30.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不介意我摸你的肚子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I don't mind you touching my belly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不介意你摸我的肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but your hand's kind of blocking the part
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你的手现在好像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}where the baby's gonna come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经摸到孩子出生的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿  -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Erica. Welcome back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  艾瑞卡  欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, look how big you've gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  你都已经变得这么丰满了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's because I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是因为我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:50.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Right. No, I understand. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:50.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哦  对  没错  我知道   -哦  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:52.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just always afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:52.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that people think I'm just fat with big breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别人以为我本来就是个胸大的胖妞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:58.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:58.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  不  不  我不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, stop staring at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  别死盯着她们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She brought them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是她先提起这事儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't realize you were coming back so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么这么快就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In a couple weeks I won't be able to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再过两个星期我就不能坐飞机了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I wanted her to get to know the doctors
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想让她先见见医生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and get settled into the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后在酒店安顿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why isn't she staying with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒店  为什么不让她和你们一起住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because we're moving in a couple days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们马上就要搬了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it just didn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:20.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, hotels are fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:20.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒店里很好玩儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My room has this little fridge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的房间里有个小冰柜里面塞满了零食
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}full of free snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erica, those things aren't free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾瑞卡  那些零食可不是免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have one of the highest markups of any consumer product--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实际上  酒店里的食品是最贵...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, she's giving us her baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  她正准备给我们生个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:34.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can eat you if she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:34.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算她把你吃了都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, man, I can't believe you guys are leaving this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信你们就要离开这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you could take it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想要这间公寓的话
