Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:44.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, there's gotta be an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:44.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肯定是有什么原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you do anything to make her mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是不是惹她生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:53.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, maybe she was just really spent from our talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:53.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道  也许她和我们讲话花费不少体力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:54.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It was pretty intense. - Yeah, mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:54.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真是非常的热烈啊  -对啊  我的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mine was a humdinger. - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的也很猛烈  -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, don't I deserve anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说  我真的那么无足轻重吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:05.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, a few tears, a cursory hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:05.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪怕是几滴眼泪  一个简单的拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是跟你抱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, if you're this upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  如果你这么在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you should go and talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该去跟她直说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And say what? You owe me a goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说什么啊  说"你还没跟我告别呢"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he's got more pride than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的自尊心往哪儿放
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The hell I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么自尊心  见鬼去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:25.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't get a goodbye? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:25.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-连再见都不跟我说   -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone gets a goodbye but me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟其他人都告过别了  为什么没有我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do I gotta do to get a goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底要我做什么你才舍得跟我说句再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be best friends with you? Go out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做你最好的朋友  和你约会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:34.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have a baby with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:34.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你生个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wait a minute. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  等一下  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did all those things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些我好像都做过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or maybe I'm just not giving you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  也许我应该
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:41.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...enough credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:41.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}体谅你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:45.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it is difficult to say goodbye to five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:45.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许连续跟五个人说再见是太困难了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye, goodbye, goodbye, goodbye, g--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见  再见  再见  再见  再...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's physically impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生理上是做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After all we've been through...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经历了这多多年的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...l can't believe this is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}how you want to leave things between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是你想要的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have a good time in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你在巴黎一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope Ross isn't too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望罗斯不会太沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure he's not more bummed out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- ...than I am. - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我比他难过  -谁说不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we don't know how to throw a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不会组织派对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I'm gonna head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:20.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:20.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought I was going home to bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打算回家睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:23.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'm sensing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:23.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过现在我感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}there's something less fun for me to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人要逼我留下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:28.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're moving in a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:28.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们马上就要搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and we got a lot of packing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有很多东西需要收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'd be great if you guys could pitch in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们能来帮忙就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey and I can finish up the guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊和我可以继续收拾客房
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:36.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:36.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  是啊  好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. You and Phoebe are gonna help me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢  不行   你和菲比留在这儿帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You couldn't be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不会装得冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna start in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  让我们从厨房开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plates get put into plate protectors
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先盘子放在盘套里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and stacked 10 to a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后十个一组装箱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The silverware gets bundled in rubber bands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}银器要先用橡胶膜捆上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then bubble wrapped. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后用塑料泡沫包上  明白了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:54.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:54.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. I need you to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  你们要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and efficient. And remember, if I'm harsh with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同时动作要快  记住  如果我朝你们叫唤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it is only because you're doing it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那肯定是你们哪里做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:07.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Mon, I think I figured out whose handcuffs they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:07.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  莫妮卡  我想我知道手铐是谁的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I was cleaning out the closet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚才在收拾柜子的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I found some pictures of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发现了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:16.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- ...being used. - Oh, my God, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:16.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-与之相关的照片  -天呐  让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's that dirty old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这下流的老女人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica's grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡的祖母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nana liked it rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奶奶喜欢狂野哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨  -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, here, have a seat. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-来  坐下  坐下   -对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How was your night? - Oh, it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-今天晚上过得怎么样  -还不错.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went to a movie with my cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和我堂兄去看了场电影
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:37.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then out for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:37.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后一起吃了晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We went to this place that had--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们去的餐厅...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, they had these really amazing cheeseburgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之呢  那家餐厅的起司汉堡真是棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erica, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾瑞卡  你是不是不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you know, maybe I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一点  可能是我吃多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I keep getting these stomachaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的胃一直有点疼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They come and go every few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每隔几分钟就疼一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Relax, we'll just get her some antacids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别紧张  我们给她点胃药就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't have a stomachache! She's in labor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是胃痛  那是阵痛的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
